1 NAME Johannes Augustinus /Dezentjé/
2 GIVN Johannes Augustinus
2 SURN Dezentjé
2 _MARNM Dezentjé
2 NICK Tinus
2 NICK Tinus Dezentje
1 NAME Johannes Augustines (Tinus) Dezentje
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 12 APR 1797
2 ADDR
3 CITY Ampel
3 STAE Central Java
3 CTRY Indonesia
1 DEAT
2 DATE 7 NOV 1839
2 ADDR
3 CITY Ampel
3 STAE Jawa Tengah
3 CTRY Indonesia
1 OCCU Officier in het koloniale leger, Plantage eigenaar
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Er kämpfte gegen den Java Prinz Diponegoro. Der Prinz rebellierte auf der Insel Java gegen die holländische Besatzung zwischen 1825 und 1830.
2 CONT
2 CONT Johannes Augustinus heirate in 3er Ehe eine Javaprinzessin.
2 CONT
2 CONT Er hatte 14 Söhne und 14 Töchter
2 CONT
2 CONT Ampèl is the name of the family estate (1.275 ha in 1837) it was leased from the Sultan of Solo (Solo=present Soerakarta). Ampèl is located mid-way between Salatiga and Bojolali close to the Postroad from Salatiga to Soerakarta in
2 CONC  central Java. (South of the coastal city of Semarang). Tinus planted mostly coffee and was locally known as the "coffee king."
2 CONT
2 CONT Around 1947-48, the entrance way and house were demolished and burned.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hij had 27 of 28 kinderen (14 zonen, 14 dochters waarvan een aangenomen) bij vier vrouwen (of meer)
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-1-358781051-3-500506/johannes-augustinus-tinus-dezentje-in-myheritage-family-trees?indId=externalindividual-6cbebb5e23b848f1c54b22febad30e86&mrid=0aae99d9a4f038f622a4299e699
2 CONC 07a91 MyHeritage Family Trees] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jul 7 2017, 14:00:34 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-1-358781051-3-500506/johannes-augustinus-tinus-dezentje-in-myheritage-family-trees?indId=externalindividual-019d8605c1d32838fc8e037bd7f5d124&mrid=50a28f4792262029f4effd0e844
2 CONC aaa25 MyHeritage Family Trees] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jul 7 2017, 12:10:45 UTC''
2 CONT
