1 NAME Pakubuwana II Raden Mas Prabasuyasa (1726-1742) (1745-1749)
2 GIVN Pakubuwana II Raden Mas Prabasuyasa (1726-1742) (1745-1749)
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 ADDR
3 CITY Imogiri
3 STAE Special Region of Yogyakarta
