2 CONT '''[http://soemodilogo.org/index.php?mn=3 4 Generations Descendants Circle Diagram]'''<br/>
2 CONT '''[https://lookaside.fbsbx.com/file/Silsilah%20SOEMODILOGO%20-%20Edisi-1%20tahun%202017.pdf?token=AWwRzJgspOuf8wVd-E9WO5ilAMdlPqeCRLk7UTBlvLgv0C6sZZ6urifgL9f0PGVZprig7w6q4d3wMu43MLqTZDJQm38Z2i-EMcSugEsV5c311Rq9t3T6ImD9VAITVxmBu0j
